                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.5048/32: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in Liberia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Francis</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-06-19T17:00:00-04:00">June 19, 1929—5
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>10. Your 19, June 18, 2 p.m. Your course of action meets with the Department’s
                    approval.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Clark</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
